WEBVTT

01:31.830 --> 01:33.630
This is the third stage of her curse.

01:34.080 --> 01:35.540
What's that gonna do?

01:36.710 --> 01:41.380
It traps her victims in the burning pleasure district,
from which they cannot escape.

01:42.170 --> 01:45.080
There, they will feel the boiling heat of Hell itself...

01:47.710 --> 01:48.960
...in her Burning Manse.

01:53.750 --> 01:54.540
Here it comes.

02:14.130 --> 02:15.170
That won't work.

02:16.750 --> 02:21.670
The butterflies spawning from her curse
suck out the souls of whoever they land on,

02:22.130 --> 02:25.830
then use that soul as fuel
when they transform into a raging fire.

02:26.750 --> 02:30.460
They will burn until that fuel is used up.

02:31.080 --> 02:35.210
Without any energy left, the victim must either pass on,

02:35.500 --> 02:41.790
or experience the pain of burning alive
until the Oiran is sealed once more,

02:42.460 --> 02:47.040
trapped in a never-ending, soul-fueled blaze.

03:10.670 --> 03:12.040
He's trying to heal himself.

03:17.630 --> 03:22.540
But he's trapped in the Manse,
so the spirits he pulled in are lighting on fire, too!

03:32.080 --> 03:33.670
So hot...

03:37.670 --> 03:38.750
He's falling apart!

03:39.130 --> 03:44.080
Meanwhile... the Oiran breathes in
the smoke from the burning souls...

03:50.290 --> 03:51.920
...healing her back to full strength.

03:52.830 --> 03:58.750
The only way he can stop her now
is to completely consume her.

03:59.960 --> 04:00.830
What will he do?

04:23.040 --> 04:26.830
Flames, pestilence, aging:

04:27.460 --> 04:32.130
consumed by these three curses,
he can do nothing to fight back.

04:32.630 --> 04:36.210
Both spirits can heal and bolster their strength,

04:36.830 --> 04:40.670
but since she had more ways to heal herself,
she came out on top.

04:52.920 --> 04:58.500
Centuries ago, the Yoshiwara pleasure district
burned to the ground... Yet, I see it here, now!

04:59.210 --> 05:00.580
The battle's over.

05:01.420 --> 05:03.380
Now, we have to reseal the Oiran.

05:04.130 --> 05:06.670
She's distracted by her gleeful victory.

05:07.580 --> 05:08.750
Now's our chance.

05:11.210 --> 05:13.960
Wait, when did they get so close?!

05:17.080 --> 05:22.210
She's after us. Her gleeful dance
was a feint to get us to put our guard down.

05:23.130 --> 05:24.830
Keitaro, get her sealed!

05:26.000 --> 05:27.670
Same seal as the High Priest!

05:28.630 --> 05:29.290
Got it!

05:29.500 --> 05:31.170
I'll handle the Oiran.

05:32.290 --> 05:33.080
Sever her...

05:49.000 --> 05:51.130
Suicide at Sengon-Kegon Falls.

05:54.290 --> 05:56.420
That's the ghost from Castle H!

06:08.540 --> 06:12.580
Keitaro, she's not worn out from that battle!

06:13.330 --> 06:14.880
It's only made her more powerful!

06:15.540 --> 06:17.290
She's going to attack again, so hurry!

06:18.000 --> 06:18.710
Okay!

06:23.040 --> 06:23.750
Eiko!

06:28.460 --> 06:29.540
Make your choice.

06:30.670 --> 06:33.040
As in, choose who she's going to kill?

06:43.630 --> 06:49.170
Her "district" is confined to
a few meters around the Oiran herself,

06:49.830 --> 06:53.080
but her butterflies can fly wherever they want.

06:53.630 --> 06:58.460
If she transforms those flames into butterflies,
sealing her will be way more difficult...

07:04.380 --> 07:05.420
Go for her eyes.

07:11.170 --> 07:12.250
You little bitch!

07:14.790 --> 07:18.630
I knew it. The butterflies
can only attack targets she can see.

07:19.250 --> 07:21.040
Focus on the ones that get close!

07:29.420 --> 07:30.380
Oh, no!

07:35.880 --> 07:36.830
Gotta hurry!

07:54.250 --> 07:57.130
One day, I will be free.

07:57.580 --> 08:03.460
And on that day, I will wring
every last drop of blood from your veins!

08:03.460 --> 08:06.630
I will kill every last member
of your dynasty until none remain!

08:06.630 --> 08:09.460
This I swear!

08:14.500 --> 08:16.830
Thank you. We couldn't have made it out without you.

08:17.210 --> 08:19.130
I'll bring you some sacred sake as thanks.

08:23.630 --> 08:24.670
I'll hold you to that.

08:29.380 --> 08:30.290
We did it.

08:30.670 --> 08:31.960
Nope, not yet.

08:36.250 --> 08:40.710
Sealing her up removed her curses
of illness and old age.

08:41.080 --> 08:44.830
But he's been left with such little energy
that he can barely move.

08:46.330 --> 08:52.670
I hate you, Mom. I hate you for what you did to my dad.

08:57.210 --> 08:59.710
You're not my mom...

09:04.460 --> 09:06.830
I'm so hungry.

09:07.420 --> 09:09.460
I'll fill your belly.

09:10.750 --> 09:14.710
I can't let you consume whoever you want.

09:15.040 --> 09:18.380
But I can let you feed on specific targets.

09:19.540 --> 09:21.210
Really...?

09:21.710 --> 09:27.750
Really. I'll keep you well-fed until your rage subsides,

09:28.710 --> 09:31.460
and you won't be hungry ever again.

09:34.000 --> 09:36.130
So, come with me.

09:38.290 --> 09:45.830
Okay. I don't... want to see...
my Mom... everywhere again.

09:49.670 --> 09:53.380
Got me the ghost of the Old I Watergate.

09:56.290 --> 10:01.380
You killed innocent people.
We had to punish you for that.

10:01.670 --> 10:07.710
I'll acknowledge it was unpleasant, but I won't apologize.

10:08.670 --> 10:11.790
However, your circumstances do warrant sympathy.

10:13.500 --> 10:19.710
So, I'll stay with you until the day
your grudge is washed away.

10:20.580 --> 10:27.210
You may never see me as an ally, but to prove
I'm not your enemy, I'll give you your sketchbook.

10:30.670 --> 10:35.210
With that, our battle with
the Old I Watergate ghost came to a close.

10:37.630 --> 10:41.710
We only survived 'cause all three of us worked together.

10:43.290 --> 10:45.210
Good thing we weren't short a person this time...

10:45.500 --> 10:50.790
Yeah. I'm realizing now that having more people
raises our chances of survival,

10:51.210 --> 10:53.540
so you're coming with me for all of these haunts.

10:54.330 --> 10:55.210
But don't worry.

10:56.380 --> 10:58.420
I promise to protect you both.

11:02.630 --> 11:03.330
Look.

11:06.040 --> 11:07.250
Shami-san?

11:10.170 --> 11:11.500
Whoa, Yayoi-chan?!

11:11.500 --> 11:14.750
It'll be easier if we confirm her identity
before calling the cops.

11:21.460 --> 11:22.330
Wait...

11:23.880 --> 11:26.790
that looks like the relic
that drove the Castle H ghost insane.

11:27.330 --> 11:29.710
Uh-huh. Looks like this is other half of the pair.

11:30.080 --> 11:31.960
But why would Shami-san have it?

11:32.540 --> 11:34.250
Why would a spiritualist be involved?

11:34.830 --> 11:39.250
Why place curses instead of exorcising them?
Was she acting alone, or part of a group?

11:39.750 --> 11:44.170
What are they hoping to achieve by creating evil spirits?

11:45.580 --> 11:50.000
Perhaps she'd just secured the relic,
but there's still too much that doesn't make sense...

11:51.630 --> 11:52.920
Where's her spirit?

11:56.330 --> 11:57.290
I don't see it.

11:57.960 --> 12:02.630
Maybe the boy ate both her body and her soul?

12:02.750 --> 12:06.960
Even if his curse turned her soul into meatballs,

12:07.460 --> 12:10.170
we should still find the part of her that wasn't consumed.

12:11.830 --> 12:17.790
If she's not here, then she was either washed
downstream, or passed on to the afterlife.

12:18.130 --> 12:23.040
That, or the soul in her body
was of a completely different form.

12:23.790 --> 12:25.540
A different form?

12:26.670 --> 12:27.750
She'd been replaced?!

12:28.040 --> 12:31.960
Mm-hmm. A ghost could take over
someone with spiritual powers.

12:32.880 --> 12:34.790
Horrifying, but not impossible.

12:35.960 --> 12:39.580
Something smells fishy. For now, we'll take this with us.

12:38.580 --> 12:40.080
<b>ANIMOSITY WARD</b>

12:40.330 --> 12:43.790
We also need to come up with a story
to cover this up and deal with the ghost parts.

12:44.080 --> 12:47.130
Let's give the cops a call and let them know
we've discovered bodies.

12:50.880 --> 12:55.540
Hello, police? I'm at the river,
and there are tons of corpses floating downstream...

12:56.000 --> 12:58.210
Y-yes, I'm sure they're not just mannekins.

12:58.540 --> 13:03.420
Huh? Um, no, I just... I was walking by, and...

13:14.460 --> 13:20.380
Once the police confirmed our reports,
they started cleaning up the corpses in the water.

13:21.540 --> 13:24.330
When we gave them our cover story...

13:24.330 --> 13:27.130
Mind answering a couple more questions for us?

13:27.130 --> 13:29.380
...they asked us to come down to the station with them.

13:27.500 --> 13:28.250
Sure.

13:28.250 --> 13:29.380
Thanks.

13:29.380 --> 13:30.000
No prob.

13:38.460 --> 13:43.580
Man, I've still got mad chills.
Gonna take a while to wear off after an S-Rank, huh...?

13:47.040 --> 13:49.540
Are they still following us?

13:54.540 --> 13:55.710
What's wrong?

13:56.290 --> 14:00.540
N-nothing, just think I'm a little tired.

14:09.460 --> 14:10.250
This way.

14:10.670 --> 14:11.750
Y-yes, sir.

14:14.710 --> 14:17.000
Must've been my imagination.

14:17.580 --> 14:20.080
<b>Interview Room</b>

14:20.790 --> 14:21.580
Keitaro.

14:22.330 --> 14:24.000
Thanks for waiting.

14:24.540 --> 14:25.210
Ready to go?

14:30.880 --> 14:32.960
Sh..Shami-san?!

14:33.500 --> 14:36.250
What, you know my little sister?

14:37.130 --> 14:39.330
You're her sister, then?

14:39.580 --> 14:43.290
Yeah. The name's Namiko Shami.

14:44.630 --> 14:51.210
You're the ones who found her, yeah?
Sounds like you knew her. Well enough to kill her.

14:52.580 --> 14:55.330
You were there the moment she died, weren't you?

14:55.330 --> 15:01.210
We didn't do it! We didn't! We just happened to be there!

14:59.330 --> 15:01.210
We literally just met her today!

15:01.210 --> 15:04.540
What makes you think we did it, or witnessed her death?

15:05.380 --> 15:09.000
Anyone would if they knew you were
carrying around that demon you're holding.

15:09.500 --> 15:10.330
She has the sight.

15:11.080 --> 15:12.670
You have powers, too?

15:12.960 --> 15:16.170
Yeah. A ghost killed her, didn't they?

15:16.540 --> 15:17.130
Yeah.

15:17.460 --> 15:22.250
But I caught it and sealed it, so consider the case closed.

15:25.750 --> 15:27.670
Seems she's telling the truth.

15:29.170 --> 15:31.040
Never met a kid like you before!

15:31.380 --> 15:36.170
Gotta say, I like you! You'd be good at the craft.
I'll teach you if you want!

15:36.420 --> 15:39.080
Sh-she's getting scouted!

15:39.170 --> 15:41.500
How long would it take, and why should I choose you?

15:41.750 --> 15:48.080
Ten years, and you could take out most spirits.
You'd also inherit our ancestral weapons.

15:48.670 --> 15:49.710
Sounds good,

15:50.380 --> 15:52.000
but doesn't seem worth the cost.

15:52.380 --> 15:54.040
I can beat most spirits now, anyway.

15:54.290 --> 15:56.250
She just said no!

15:56.710 --> 15:57.960
Is that right?

15:57.960 --> 15:59.210
And she's upset.

15:59.420 --> 16:05.040
Question for you: Have you heard of any professionals
getting replaced by ghosts?

16:05.750 --> 16:06.580
Yeah.

16:07.330 --> 16:09.880
I know Nagiko was replaced.

16:11.040 --> 16:12.750
Wait, so you knew?

16:13.920 --> 16:17.960
You have the sight, right? Then you should see it, too.

16:20.130 --> 16:24.830
Each person has a colored aura
that changes hues with their emotion.

16:25.420 --> 16:28.250
When they get replaced, though,
the base color changes.

16:30.250 --> 16:32.420
You haven't changed, though.

16:32.750 --> 16:37.920
That doesn't mean much.
Smart ghosts only replace people with their same color.

16:38.540 --> 16:45.710
Without the sight, watch how they behave,
how they interact with friends and family.

16:45.880 --> 16:49.000
It's still tough to tell, though,
so don't ever let your guard down.

16:49.750 --> 16:53.330
Been hearing lately that lots
of other professionals have been replaced.

16:53.670 --> 17:00.420
Nagiko didn't have much talent for it.
That's why she went on TV instead.

17:01.000 --> 17:06.040
Ironically, that’s probably why
they went after her first. What a disgrace.

17:06.710 --> 17:08.920
Th-that's harsh...

17:08.920 --> 17:11.830
She was your sister. Aren't you upset she's gone?

17:12.630 --> 17:15.170
I stopped crying once I turned sixty.

17:15.710 --> 17:20.500
I'll throw every last one of those spirits
into the depths of Hell.

17:21.040 --> 17:24.880
Their blood will serve as the tears I shed.

17:27.670 --> 17:29.540
Call me if you ever need anything.

17:31.040 --> 17:32.580
My offer's still open.

17:34.960 --> 17:36.000
We'll see how I feel.

17:35.080 --> 17:36.500
<b>Yayoi Hozuki</b>

17:47.750 --> 17:50.330
All right, let's make room in storage.

17:50.880 --> 17:53.630
We're gonna get a bunch of evidence
from the crime scene.

17:53.750 --> 17:54.500
Yes, sir.

17:55.290 --> 17:57.830
I'm still pretty freaked out, though.

17:59.250 --> 18:03.790
The way those bodies were torn apart,
no one knows how someone could've done it.

18:04.500 --> 18:07.000
Feels like something out of a horror movie...

18:07.880 --> 18:12.040
You ever heard the story about
the evidence locker in H Precinct?

18:12.040 --> 18:13.920
No, what is it?

18:14.250 --> 18:16.750
The precinct's moved since, but here's the story:

18:17.880 --> 18:22.170
It was an old, tiny building,
with barely any space for bigger items.

18:22.710 --> 18:27.580
So they had a separate facility on H Mountain.

18:28.330 --> 18:32.080
That's where they kept evidence
involved in murders or fatal accidents.

18:33.540 --> 18:40.460
Some guys swore they could hear whispers in there
and refused to ever go inside.

18:41.210 --> 18:43.080
Eh, looks like we've got enough room.

18:45.040 --> 18:46.380
And nothing ever happened!

18:47.130 --> 18:48.920
Of course nothing ever happened!

18:57.880 --> 19:00.210
A kid? It's like, midnight.

19:00.630 --> 19:02.040
The hell? Must be lost.

19:04.670 --> 19:06.250
Hey, kid! Come back here!

19:06.920 --> 19:07.830
Christ.

19:14.920 --> 19:16.540
Hey, kiddo. You lost?

19:37.040 --> 19:40.880
Gimme... your head.

19:46.290 --> 19:49.750
There you are. What're you sitting on the floor for?

19:53.710 --> 19:54.960
My head...

19:55.710 --> 19:58.330
Give me back my head.

19:58.630 --> 19:59.500
My head...

20:00.750 --> 20:02.130
Your head...

20:05.540 --> 20:09.880
Gimme... Gimmie your head.

20:16.330 --> 20:18.880
Holy shit... What the hell happened here?

20:19.000 --> 20:20.000
<b>HEAD</b>

20:19.000 --> 20:20.000
<b>HEAD</b>

20:19.000 --> 20:20.000
<b>HEAD</b>

20:19.000 --> 20:20.000
<b>HEAD</b>

20:24.630 --> 20:29.250
Hours later, all the affected officers passed away.

20:29.830 --> 20:38.830
Autopsy revealed their brains were riddled with holes,
and their bodies were necrotic.

20:39.040 --> 20:44.790
<b>HEAD</b>

20:39.040 --> 20:44.790
<b>HEAD</b>

20:39.040 --> 20:44.790
<b>HEAD</b>

20:39.540 --> 20:44.710
The only wound on their body was the cut
on their finger used to write "head" in blood.

20:45.170 --> 20:49.080
No fingerprints or other evidence
was found connecting a person to the crime,

20:49.250 --> 20:52.250
and the cause of death was left as "unknown."

20:53.250 --> 20:58.170
The police decided not to release information
about the strange incident to the public.

20:59.880 --> 21:04.750
We now turn back in time slightly to 2 AM,
right after the incident occurred...

21:05.040 --> 21:07.380
I made it safe and sound, Oswald!

21:07.710 --> 21:14.330
<b>Ongoing Call...</b>

21:08.080 --> 21:14.080
I'm glad to hear it. It should be near your location. Any
signs, Dorothy?

21:16.460 --> 21:21.330
There it is! Not-Shami-san! Over here!

21:24.500 --> 21:27.250
K Park in A City, please!

21:31.460 --> 21:37.580
Huh? The ghost at the Old I Watergate killed you,
then got caught by a team of three?

21:38.630 --> 21:40.880
And one of those three was a little kid?

21:43.000 --> 21:46.750
Now, that's someone I'd like to meet!

23:22.130 --> 23:29.630
Vacation ends, and Yayoi returns to school,
only to be greeted by a strange girl and her doll.

23:30.920 --> 23:39.500
When her scary stories become reality, the school
becomes a playground where their lives are on the line.
